--- Direction ---
Only reading (ii) reproduces the negative-control value of about 0.0032 (P1, N = 678):
it corresponds to TREATING THE HALF-WIDTH delta/2 AS THE FULL-WIDTH TARGET, i.e. a
target twice as strict as the published one. Reading (iii), 2*delta as full width, is
the opposite (looser) misreading and gives the assurance shown in the table.

